                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is the CPL benchmark for jewelry Meta Ads in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Fashion Advantage+ Shopping Rs 200-800 CPL. Fine Rs 500-2,000. Bridal Rs 1,500-5,000 form-fill. Lab-grown Rs 500-1,800. Men's Rs 300-900. Click-to-WhatsApp variants 30-40% lower CPL than form-fill. Retargeting variants 30-50% lower CPL than cold acquisition.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the CPL benchmark for jewelry Google Ads in India?</h3>
                                        <p>Fashion Google Search Rs 60-250 CPL. Fine Rs 350-1,500. Bridal Rs 800-3,500. Lab-grown Rs 400-1,500. Men's Rs 200-900. Google Shopping 30-50% lower CPL than Search. Performance Max 20-40% higher CPL but broader reach.</p>
                                        <h3>How much does jewelry advertising cost in UAE + Saudi Arabia?</h3>
                                        <p>UAE fashion Meta AED 8-30 CPL (Rs 175-660). UAE fine Meta AED 40-150 (Rs 880-3,300). Saudi Snapchat SAR 8-60 CPL (Rs 185-1,380). KSA CPLs 15-35% higher than UAE + India due to Snapchat + Arabic-first creative + luxury premium.</p>
                                        <h3>What drives jewelry CPL up?</h3>
                                        <p>Creative fatigue (30-60% increase), weak landing page (20-40%), missing schema + Merchant Center hygiene (15-30%), broad-match without negatives (25-45%), missing Meta Pixel + CAPI (20-40% iOS 14+ ATT loss), weak audience targeting interest-only (30-60%).</p>
                                        <h3>What drives jewelry CPL down?</h3>
                                        <p>Creative volume + refresh cadence 15-30 new / week (20-40% decrease), custom + lookalikes from best-LTV (30-50%), click-to-WhatsApp vs form-fill (30-40%), AR + video content (15-25%), full-funnel attribution + offline conversion import (20-30%), dedicated landing pages per campaign (15-30%).</p>
                                        <h3>Why does SQL cost matter more than CPL for jewelry?</h3>
                                        <p>CPL &rarr; SQL &rarr; closed-won conversion rates vary materially. Fashion typical CPL Rs 200-800 &rarr; SQL Rs 500-2,000 &rarr; Closed-won CAC Rs 1,000-4,500. Fine + bridal SQL cost 3-6x CPL. Optimising CPL without CRM + closed-won attribution optimises the wrong metric. Insist on full attribution.</p>
                                        <h3>What Meta campaign type should we start with?</h3>
                                        <p>Advantage+ Shopping if you have 100+ SKUs + 30+ conversions logged. Meta Conversions (Form Fill) if pre-launch or low-catalogue. Click-to-WhatsApp for high-consideration fine + bridal (30-40% lower CPL). Retargeting always parallel with cold acquisition.</p>
                                        <h3>How does ITD GrowthLabs benchmark client CPL?</h3>
                                        <p>Rs 8 Cr+ annual managed ad spend across 100+ D2C accounts including jewelry. Continuous benchmarking + monthly CPL / SQL / CAC review + creative + landing-page + audience + attribution optimisation. See our <a href="/resources/jewelry_google_ads_search_shopping_pmax.php">jewelry Google Ads playbook</a> + <a href="/resources/jewelry_meta_ads_creative_reels_carousel_live.php">jewelry Meta Ads playbook</a>.</p>
